{"c":[{"id":"6936d2244b2292af","sum":"B28b: an Ask with an EXCLUSION_WORDS word (scope-words.ts) gets no name trust; a SECTION phrase trusts only fields of its meaning. D2-04: a control's value never goes on the wire as FillField.value; Fill all writes controls whose FillHandoff.writes is true.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T063813Z-3bd79ae87e6b8e79","text":"B28b: an Ask instruction with a scope-words.ts EXCLUSION_WORDS word gets no name trust (Jev confirms every field); a SECTION phrase trusts only fields of its meaning (isContactField; up top, my details: none). Restriction word lists stay open; each review found more.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T080809Z-f16da6d6064b889b","text":"D2-04: a control's value never goes on the wire as FillField.value (zod and the host decoder refuse it on any control but text); a Fill all writes the controls whose FillHandoff.writes is true, through writtenFields.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4fad04d8f129b479","sum":"D2-04: a box gets a tick only when its label is a question to the user (fill/controls.ts boxKind); never widen it by adding consent words. accept.ts's fixture reader answers watchInput ok, so accept runs executor tasks on page windows.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T080829Z-0265fdcfcf17917c","text":"D2-04: a box gets a tick by its label's kind (fill/controls.ts boxKind: only a question to the user may be written, a first-person statement never gets a value); consent word lists failed open in both reviews, so never widen the box rule by adding words alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T080829Z-0557296abbc22e11","text":"D2-04: accept.ts's fixture reader answers watchInput ok, so accept now runs executor tasks on page windows (B28's 'accept cannot run executor.run' no longer holds); page input still comes from the extension's guard.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
